/T (Network Connectivity Verification  After completing the networkconfiguration, connectivity tests were performed between Ubuntu, Kali Linux, and the Windows host using the ICMP Ping utility.  The test results confirmed successful communication between Ubuntu and Kali Linux, as  well as between the Windows host and both virtual machines. This verified that the Host- Only network was functioning correctly and that all systems were able to exchange data  before deploying the Wazuh monitoring platform.  These successful connectivity tests ensured that the environment was fully prepared for  packet analysis using Wireshark and for the deployment of the Wazuh SIEM infrastructure. )
