/T (Netplan Configuration Before Editing  The default Netplan configuration file was configured to obtain IP addresses dynamically  using DHCP for both network interfaces \(ens33 and ens34\). While this setup provided  network connectivity, it was not appropriate for a server that required a permanent IP  address. )
/E (Netplan Configuration Before Editing  The default Netplan configuration file was configured to obtain IP addresses dynamically  using DHCP for both network interfaces \(ens33 and ens34\). While this setup provided  network connectivity, it was not appropriate for a server that required a permanent IP  address. )
