/T (since the Wazuh Manager must always remainreachable at a fixed address, the Host-Only interface was configured with a static IP.  A static IP address eliminates the possibility ofIPchanges after system reboot or network  restart. This is essential because the WindowsandKali Linux agents communicate with  the Wazuh server using its IP address. If the server'sIP changes, the agents would fail to  establish a connection until their configurationisupdated.  The network configuration file was modified usingUbuntu's Netplan utility. The Host-Only  interface \(ens34\) was assigned a permanent IPaddress, while the NAT interface \(ens33\)  continued to receive its address dynamically tomaintain internet connectivity.  After saving the configuration, the changes wereapplied successfully using the Netplan  configuration utility. The updated network settingswere verified using the ip a and ip  route commands, confirming that the static IPaddress had been assigned correctly and  that internet connectivity remained functional. The successful implementation of the static IPconfiguration ensured stable  communication between the Wazuh server andallconnected agents throughout the  laboratory exercises.  Checking Ip Route of Ubuntu )
/E (since the Wazuh Manager must always remainreachable at a fixed address, the Host-Only interface was configured with a static IP.  A static IP address eliminates the possibility ofIPchanges after system reboot or network  restart. This is essential because the WindowsandKali Linux agents communicate with  the Wazuh server using its IP address. If the server'sIP changes, the agents would fail to  establish a connection until their configurationisupdated.  The network configuration file was modified usingUbuntu's Netplan utility. The Host-Only  interface \(ens34\) was assigned a permanent IPaddress, while the NAT interface \(ens33\)  continued to receive its address dynamically tomaintain internet connectivity.  After saving the configuration, the changes wereapplied successfully using the Netplan  configuration utility. The updated network settingswere verified using the ip a and ip  route commands, confirming that the static IPaddress had been assigned correctly and  that internet connectivity remained functional. The successful implementation of the static IPconfiguration ensured stable  communication between the Wazuh server andallconnected agents throughout the  laboratory exercises.  Checking Ip Route of Ubuntu )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [4]
