/E (After successfully deploying the Wazuh SIEM server and enrolling both Windows and Kali Linux agents, the final phase of the lab focused on validating the monitoring capabilities of the environment. To generate security events, an Nmap scan was performed from the Kali Linux machine against the Windows endpoint. The objective was to observe how network reconnaissance activities are detected and recorded by the Wazuh platform. )
